Package: com.cf.carkitinstrument
Name: CarKit Instrument
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Diagnostic instrumentation for CarKit / CarPlay / FrontBoard session and display objects. Logs object graphs during a genuine CarPlay connection so the session-replay path can be mapped. Observe-only: it does not alter behaviour or touch authentication.
Maintainer: chasefloied101 <chasefloied101@gmail.com>
Author: chasefloied101 <chasefloied101@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
